<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foster's raises Ballarat bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foster's raises Ballarat bid.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foster's Brewing Group Ltd said its Carlton &amp; United Breweries Ltd unit has raised its takeover offer for hotel and leisure group Ballarat Brewing Co Ltd to A$2.56 a share from A$2.50.  </p>
<p>CUB said it was now entitled to 42.48 percent of Ballarat Brewing's issued capital, just up from 41.68 percent held when it launched its A$2.50 per share offer in November.</p>
<p>New Zealand-based investment group Guinness Peat Group Plc is also bidding for the former brewery group.</p>
<p>It is offering A$2.50 a share. GPG started the auction with a bid for 50 percent of each Ballarat Brewing shareholding at A$2.45 last June but turned this into a full offer in September.</p>
<p>Ballarat Brewing shares closed unchanged at A$2.65 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
